# Flutter (`pubspec.yaml` + Flutter SDK)

- Surface `mobile` (or per repo layout). Material/Cupertino/existing theme — no invented package.
- State = repo approach (Provider/Riverpod/Bloc/GetX) — if missing, Clarify-first.
- Const + widget extract; avoid broad `setState`.
- Navigation = existing router/Navigator.
- A11y = `Semantics`. Skip web SEO/HTML. Test = `flutter test`/`dart analyze`.
